{
  "answer": "You can define a request body using a Pydantic model in FastAPI by using the `Body` parameter annotation, like this: `from pydantic import Body; from fastapi import FastAPI; app = FastAPI(); @app.post(\"/items/\") def create_item(item: Item = Body(...)) -> dict: ...`\n\nAlternatively, you can use the `Body` parameter annotation with a specific media type, like `text/json` or `application/json`.",
